      "description": "Vivo Tamboré 1 is a state-of-the-art data center located in the dynamic region of Santana de Parnaíba, São Paulo. With a focus on hosting and cloud services, it stands as one of the largest data centers in Latin America, boasting certifications such as Tier III - Design, Facility, and Operations from the Uptime Institute. The facility has undergone significant expansion, doubling its original size to accommodate the growing demand for digital storage and management solutions.\n\nThe data center's strategic location was chosen for its elevated position, minimizing risks of natural disasters and ensuring high levels of security and availability. It is well-connected, with proximity to major transport routes and an ample supply of electrical power, thanks to nearby high-tension transmission lines. This infrastructure supports Vivo Tamboré 1's capacity for high-performance computing, with room for further expansion to meet future needs.\n\nVivo Tamboré 1 represents Telefónica Brasil's commitment to digital transformation and innovation. The investment in this facility underscores the company's dedication to providing robust and scalable solutions for businesses of all sizes, driving competitiveness and efficiency in an increasingly digital world.",
